NOTE ON THE UNDERLYING METHOD

The life-cycle cost analysis methodology implemented here was developed by the
Federal Highway Administration (RealCost; "Life-Cycle Cost Analysis in Pavement
Design", FHWA-SA-98-079) and adapted for California by the California
Department of Transportation (RealCost 2.5.7CA). Works of the United States
federal government are not subject to copyright (17 U.S.C. 105), and methods of
operation are not copyrightable subject matter (17 U.S.C. 102(b)).

This project is an independent, original implementation written from the
published methodology. It contains no code from the RealCost workbook. It is
not produced, reviewed, endorsed, or supported by FHWA or Caltrans, and it is
not a certified substitute for the official RealCost tool. The MIT license
above covers this implementation only.
